WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.097 --> 00:00:03.865
TUCKER?

00:00:03.866 --> 00:00:04.533
&gt;&gt; Tucker: AMAZING TRACE

00:00:04.534 --> 00:00:05.167
GALLAGHER THANK YOU VERY

00:00:05.168 --> 00:00:06.168
MUCH FOR THAT THE MOTHER YOU

00:00:06.169 --> 00:00:07.969
JUST SAW IN THAT VIDEO JOINS

00:00:07.970 --> 00:00:09.137
US TONIGHT FROM

00:00:09.138 --> 00:00:09.671
PHILADELPHIA.

00:00:09.672 --> 00:00:10.472
ASHLEY, THANK YOU VERY MUCH

00:00:10.473 --> 00:00:13.074
FOR COMING ON.

00:00:13.075 --> 00:00:14.209
WHAT -- YOU WERE THERE IN

00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.011
THE VIDEO WITH THREE GIRLS,

00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:17.712
I THINK TWO OF THEM ARE

00:00:17.713 --> 00:00:18.013
YOURS.

00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:19.314
HOW OLD ARE THEY?

00:00:19.315 --> 00:00:21.917
&gt;&gt; SO, MY DAUGHTERS ARE 15

00:00:21.918 --> 00:00:22.784
AND 13.

00:00:22.785 --> 00:00:24.085
AND MY DAUGHTER'S FRIEND WHO

00:00:24.086 --> 00:00:26.721
WAS WITH US IS ALSO 15.

00:00:26.722 --> 00:00:27.389
&gt;&gt; Tucker: 15 AND 13.

00:00:27.390 --> 00:00:29.357
WHAT DO THEY THINK OF THIS?

00:00:29.358 --> 00:00:32.761
&gt;&gt; IT WAS -- IT WAS A

00:00:32.762 --> 00:00:34.763
SHOCKING EXPERIENCE.

00:00:34.764 --> 00:00:36.665
WHAT IS NOT SEEN IN THAT

00:00:36.666 --> 00:00:38.366
VIDEO WAS OUR FIRST

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.368
INTERACTION WITH MR. SIMS.

00:00:40.369 --> 00:00:42.737
HE APPROACHED US ABOUT 20

00:00:42.738 --> 00:00:46.942
MINUTES BEFORE THAT, CAME

00:00:46.943 --> 00:00:48.009
IN -- I WOULD SAY CAME IN

00:00:48.010 --> 00:00:49.811
HOT AND CAME IN YELLING AT

00:00:49.812 --> 00:00:50.278
US.

00:00:50.279 --> 00:00:51.847
AND REALLY WAS YELLING VERY

00:00:51.848 --> 00:00:53.381
DIRECTLY AT THE GIRLS.

00:00:53.382 --> 00:00:54.216
VERY SPECIFICALLY AT THE

00:00:54.217 --> 00:00:56.484
GIRLS.

00:00:56.485 --> 00:00:57.752
SO, I MOVED MYSELF IN

00:00:57.753 --> 00:00:59.454
BETWEEN HIM AND THE GIRLS,

00:00:59.455 --> 00:01:00.755
ASKED HIM, YOU KNOW, PLEASE

00:01:00.756 --> 00:01:01.489
TALK TO ME.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:02.724
LET'S HAVE A CONVERSATION.

00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:04.960
THE TWO OF US AS TWO ADULTS.

00:01:04.961 --> 00:01:07.429
BUT HE CONTINUED TO YELL AT

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:08.830
THE GIRLS.

00:01:08.831 --> 00:01:10.432
AND THEN EVENTUALLY HE LEFT

00:01:10.433 --> 00:01:11.666
AND ABOUT 10 MINUTES LATER

00:01:11.667 --> 00:01:14.135
IS WHEN HE CAME BACK

00:01:14.136 --> 00:01:15.036
VIDEOTAPING US.

00:01:15.037 --> 00:01:16.905
SO, AFTER OUR FIRST

00:01:16.906 --> 00:01:17.873
ALTERCATION WITH HIM YOU

00:01:17.874 --> 00:01:19.541
KNOW, I WENT AND TALKED TO

00:01:19.542 --> 00:01:21.142
MY GIRLS.

00:01:21.143 --> 00:01:22.911
AND TOLD THEM, YOU KNOW, I'M

00:01:22.912 --> 00:01:24.179
REALLY SORRY THIS HAPPENED.

00:01:24.180 --> 00:01:25.380
I'M REALLY PROUD OF YOU GUYS

00:01:25.381 --> 00:01:26.414
FOR BEING HERE.

00:01:26.415 --> 00:01:27.515
IT WAS HOLY THURSDAY.

00:01:27.516 --> 00:01:29.251
THIS IS SOMETHING WE WANTED

00:01:29.252 --> 00:01:31.419
TO DO AS A PRAYERFUL ACT OF

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:32.721
THE SERVICE AS WE PREPARED

00:01:32.722 --> 00:01:35.523
FOR THE EASTER -- GOING TO

00:01:35.524 --> 00:01:37.092
BEGIN THAT NIGHT WITH HOLY

00:01:37.093 --> 00:01:37.792
THURSDAY MASS.

00:01:37.793 --> 00:01:40.128
AND I TOLD THEM, YOU KNOW,

00:01:40.129 --> 00:01:41.029
SOMETIMES IT'S HARD TO DO

00:01:41.030 --> 00:01:42.397
THE RIGHT THING BUT I WAS

00:01:42.398 --> 00:01:45.400
REALLY PROUD OF THEM.

00:01:45.401 --> 00:01:46.501
SADLY, IRONICALLY, THE TWO

00:01:46.502 --> 00:01:48.503
OLDER GIRLS LOOKED AT ME AND

00:01:48.504 --> 00:01:49.804
SAID MOM, THAT WAS NOTHING

00:01:49.805 --> 00:01:51.806
COMPARED TO WHAT PEOPLE WERE

00:01:51.807 --> 00:01:53.408
SCREAMING AT US AT THE MARCH

00:01:53.409 --> 00:01:54.776
FOR LIFE IN JANUARY THEY

00:01:54.777 --> 00:01:55.911
WENT TO THE MARCH FOR LIFE

00:01:55.912 --> 00:01:57.379
AT THEIR HIGH SCHOOL.

00:01:57.380 --> 00:01:58.747
SO, I GUESS I WAS GRATEFUL

00:01:58.748 --> 00:02:00.815
THAT THEY HAD HAD SOME

00:02:00.816 --> 00:02:01.416
EXPERIENCE BEFORE.

00:02:01.417 --> 00:02:02.784
THEY WERE PREPARED FOR IT

00:02:02.785 --> 00:02:03.852
AND BECAUSE THEY WERE ABLE

00:02:03.853 --> 00:02:06.054
TO KIND OF STAY CALM, THAT

00:02:06.055 --> 00:02:07.756
HELPED MY YOUNGER DAUGHTER

00:02:07.757 --> 00:02:09.024
STAY CALM.

00:02:09.025 --> 00:02:10.525
AND, YOU KNOW, WE PRAYED FOR

00:02:10.526 --> 00:02:11.226
HIM THEN.

00:02:11.227 --> 00:02:12.494
I SAID WE WILL CONTINUE TO

00:02:12.495 --> 00:02:14.829
PRAY FOR HIM.

00:02:14.830 --> 00:02:16.131
AND JUST TRY TO DO THE RIGHT

00:02:16.132 --> 00:02:16.431
THING.

00:02:16.432 --> 00:02:18.500
AND SO THEN HE CAME BACK,

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:22.671
AGAIN, VIDEOTAPING US.

00:02:22.672 --> 00:02:24.172
WE WEREN'T AS SHOCKED

00:02:24.173 --> 00:02:25.073
BECAUSE WE JUST HAD THE

00:02:25.074 --> 00:02:26.541
INTERACTION WITH HIM ABOUT

00:02:26.542 --> 00:02:27.242
10 MINUTES PRIOR.

00:02:27.243 --> 00:02:27.742
SO, YEAH.

00:02:27.743 --> 00:02:29.678
BUT IT WAS -- MY ADRENALINE

00:02:29.679 --> 00:02:31.513
WAS UP AS A MOM.

00:02:31.514 --> 00:02:33.882
MY ADRENALINE WAS RUNNING.

00:02:33.883 --> 00:02:34.482
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HE SEEMS TO

00:02:34.483 --> 00:02:34.916
THREATEN YOU.

00:02:34.917 --> 00:02:36.785
HE OFFERS MONEY FOR YOUR

00:02:36.786 --> 00:02:37.385
IDENTITIES.

00:02:37.386 --> 00:02:38.987
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:02:38.988 --> 00:02:39.821
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DID YOU FEEL

00:02:39.822 --> 00:02:40.221
THREATENED?

00:02:40.222 --> 00:02:44.192
&gt;&gt; I WAS CONCERNED FOR MY

00:02:44.193 --> 00:02:44.492
GIRLS.

00:02:44.493 --> 00:02:45.627
YOU CAN SEE ME SPEAKING IN

00:02:45.628 --> 00:02:46.294
THAT VIDEO.

00:02:46.295 --> 00:02:48.697
I WAS GENUINELY TRYING TO

00:02:48.698 --> 00:02:50.065
ENTER INTO JUST A DIALOGUE

00:02:50.066 --> 00:02:54.002
WITH HIM TO TRY TO BRING THE

00:02:54.003 --> 00:02:54.903
SITUATION, CALM IT DOWN A

00:02:54.904 --> 00:02:56.871
LITTLE BIT.

00:02:56.872 --> 00:02:58.740
AND SAY TO HIM ON FILM WE

00:02:58.741 --> 00:03:00.008
ARE REALLY HERE JUST PRAYING

00:03:00.009 --> 00:03:01.443
FOR THESE WOMEN AND BABIES.

00:03:01.444 --> 00:03:03.178
WE ARE NOT LOOKING FOR AN

00:03:03.179 --> 00:03:03.578
ALTERCATION.

00:03:03.579 --> 00:03:04.846
I NEVER COME TO CLINICS

00:03:04.847 --> 00:03:05.880
LOOKING FOR A FIGHT.

00:03:05.881 --> 00:03:08.149
IT'S ALWAYS JUST WITH

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.684
PEACEFUL, PRAYERFUL INTENT.

00:03:09.685 --> 00:03:10.685
YES, I WAS CONCERNED THAT HE

00:03:10.686 --> 00:03:12.854
SAID MULTIPLE TIMES THAT HE

00:03:12.855 --> 00:03:16.424
WANTED THE IDENTITIES OF MY

00:03:16.425 --> 00:03:17.092
DAUGHTERS.

00:03:17.093 --> 00:03:17.659
WE WERE AT THAT POINT

00:03:17.660 --> 00:03:18.093
ALREADY DONE.

00:03:18.094 --> 00:03:20.128
WE HAD FINISHED OUR PRAYERS.

00:03:20.129 --> 00:03:22.964
WE WERE LEAVING AND SO WHEN

00:03:22.965 --> 00:03:24.632
I REALIZED HE WAS NOT GOING

00:03:24.633 --> 00:03:26.134
TO ENTER INTO ANY KIND OF

00:03:26.135 --> 00:03:27.402
PRODUCTIVE DIALOGUE I

00:03:27.403 --> 00:03:27.969
THOUGHT WE WILL JUST

00:03:27.970 --> 00:03:29.137
CONTINUE OUR EXIT AND WE

00:03:29.138 --> 00:03:31.973
WILL JUST LEAVE.

00:03:31.974 --> 00:03:33.942
I NEVER THOUGHT -- I DIDN'T

00:03:33.943 --> 00:03:35.043
EVER THINK MORE WOULD REALLY

00:03:35.044 --> 00:03:36.111
COME OF IT.

00:03:36.112 --> 00:03:36.945
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO HE ATTACKS YOU

00:03:36.946 --> 00:03:39.214
IN THAT VIDEO AND ATTACKS

00:03:39.215 --> 00:03:40.348
OTHERS IN THE VIDEO WE

00:03:40.349 --> 00:03:41.750
SHOWED BEFORE FOR THEIR SKIN

00:03:41.751 --> 00:03:42.050
COLOR.

00:03:42.051 --> 00:03:44.119
WHAT WAS THAT ABOUT?

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.353
WAS THAT OUT OF NOWHERE?

00:03:45.354 --> 00:03:47.522
WHAT DOES THAT MEAN?

00:03:47.523 --> 00:03:49.090
&gt;&gt; I HAVE NO IDEA WHAT IT

00:03:49.091 --> 00:03:49.391
MEANS.

00:03:49.392 --> 00:03:51.026
YOU WOULD HAVE TO ASK HIM.

00:03:51.027 --> 00:03:53.461
I MEAN, MY DAUGHTERS AND I

00:03:53.462 --> 00:03:54.496
ARE CAUCASIAN BUT WE WERE

00:03:54.497 --> 00:03:55.997
THERE TO PRAY FOR ALL WOMEN.

00:03:55.998 --> 00:03:56.965
WE CERTAINLY DON'T LOOK AT

00:03:56.966 --> 00:03:58.933
THE COLOR OF THEIR SKIN AS

00:03:58.934 --> 00:03:59.868
THEY COME OR GO.

00:03:59.869 --> 00:04:02.404
MY DAUGHTER'S FRIEND IS NOT

00:04:02.405 --> 00:04:02.771
CAUCASIAN.

00:04:02.772 --> 00:04:04.939
THAT'S VERY EVIDENT AND HER

00:04:04.940 --> 00:04:06.174
VIDEO AND PICTURES.

00:04:06.175 --> 00:04:07.542
SHE SAID SEVERAL TIMES TO

00:04:07.543 --> 00:04:09.044
HIM OVER THE COURSE OF OUR

00:04:09.045 --> 00:04:11.413
INTERACTIONS I'M NOT WHITE,

00:04:11.414 --> 00:04:11.679
SIR.

00:04:11.680 --> 00:04:12.981
I KNOW IT'S IN THE VIDEO AT

00:04:12.982 --> 00:04:14.215
LEAST ONCE.

00:04:14.216 --> 00:04:15.583
SO, FORTUNATELY WE KIND OF

00:04:15.584 --> 00:04:16.851
GOT A LAUGH OUT OF THAT

00:04:16.852 --> 00:04:18.253
BECAUSE WHAT HE WAS SAYING

00:04:18.254 --> 00:04:19.487
LITERALLY JUST DIDN'T MAKE

00:04:19.488 --> 00:04:19.788
SENSE.

00:04:19.789 --> 00:04:21.623
IT DIDN'T MAKE SENSE.

00:04:21.624 --> 00:04:23.391
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S A RACIST

00:04:23.392 --> 00:04:23.725
ATTACK.

00:04:23.726 --> 00:04:24.225
IT'S BIZARRE.

00:04:24.226 --> 00:04:25.860
HAS THE DEMOCRATIC PARTY OF

00:04:25.861 --> 00:04:28.029
PENNSYLVANIA OR PHILADELPHIA

00:04:28.030 --> 00:04:30.098
APOLOGIZED TO YOU?

00:04:30.099 --> 00:04:32.500
&gt;&gt; I HAVE NOT BEEN

00:04:32.501 --> 00:04:32.934
CONTACTED.

00:04:32.935 --> 00:04:33.535
&gt;&gt; Tucker: BY ANYBODY?

00:04:33.536 --> 00:04:33.835
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:33.836 --> 00:04:35.170
I HAVEN'T BEEN CONTACTED BY

00:04:35.171 --> 00:04:36.471
ANYONE IN THE DEMOCRATIC

00:04:36.472 --> 00:04:37.305
PARTY ABOUT THIS SITUATION

00:04:37.306 --> 00:04:39.741
AT ALL.

00:04:39.742 --> 00:04:42.677
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HE CALLED YOU

00:04:42.678 --> 00:04:43.011
RACIST.

00:04:43.012 --> 00:04:44.179
AS I UNDERSTAND IT YOU ARE

00:04:44.180 --> 00:04:46.648
ARGUING FOR FEWER ABORTIONS

00:04:46.649 --> 00:04:47.449
AMONG AFRICAN-AMERICAN

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:47.749
WOMEN.

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:48.983
IS HE ARGUING FOR MORE.

00:04:48.984 --> 00:04:50.752
BUT YOU ARE THE RACIST?

00:04:50.753 --> 00:04:52.921
&gt;&gt; YES.

00:04:52.922 --> 00:04:53.588
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DOES THAT MAKE

00:04:53.589 --> 00:04:53.888
SENSE?

00:04:53.889 --> 00:04:54.255
&gt;&gt; NO.

00:04:54.256 --> 00:04:55.723
IT DOESN'T MAKE SENSE TO ME.

00:04:55.724 --> 00:04:57.525
YOU WOULD HAVE TO ASK

00:04:57.526 --> 00:04:59.094
MR. SIMS WHAT HIS LOGIC IS

00:04:59.095 --> 00:05:03.498
BEHIND THAT.

00:05:03.499 --> 00:05:04.199
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HE WON'T COME ON

00:05:04.200 --> 00:05:04.699
TONIGHT.

00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:05.934
YOU WERE GRACIOUS ENOUGH TO

00:05:05.935 --> 00:05:07.069
COME.

